      <transcript>TATABALZA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. i. To make repeated motions of pulling or stretching; to jerk; to be nervous, have nervous spasms or twitches; to be hesitant; to refrain from; to be clumsy or awkward as a result of nervousness or hesitation (cf. tataγalza-).</definition>
